    "background_story": "Haven was a gentle soul with a quick wit and a penchant for clever wordplay. As a stand-up comedian, he often incorporated puns into his routines, leaving audiences groaning and laughing in equal measure. Despite his punily small stature, Haven's presence on stage was larger than life. He had a way of using humor to bring people together, often tackling tough topics with a lighthearted touch. Haven's love of puns was contagious, and soon his fans were sharing their own puns on social media using the hashtag #HavensPuns. His pun-filled comedy specials became a sensation, earning him a reputation as the 'Pun Master General.' Haven's ability to find humor in the mundane and make people laugh was a gift, and his puns brought joy to countless fans around the world.",
